    <string name="about_how_it_works">How Ledger protects your data</string>
    <string name="about_how_it_works_summary">Encryption, the browser bridge and 2FA in plain words.</string>
    <string name="about_how_it_works_body">Every password and 2FA secret is encrypted on this phone with AES-256 before it\'s saved. The key is held by Android Keystore and never leaves the phone.\n\nWhen you fill a login on your computer, the password is encrypted with a one-time key from the QR code on your screen. The relay in between only ever sees scrambled data.\n\nHome checks the strength of every saved password and lists the ones worth changing.\n\nBackups are encrypted with a password you choose, so only you can restore them.</string>
